# Raw EXFO JSON scans are local-only: with the current 1M-datapoint sweeps
# they run ~150 MB each, well past GitHub's 100 MB file limit. Only the
# trimmed .npz derivatives (produced alongside each scan) are tracked.
raw_data/*.json

# Per-scenario raw synthetic data from the validation harness (~29 MB each,
# ~800 MB across the full matrix) -- fully regeneratable by re-running
# simulation/validate_aux_pipeline.py. Only the lightweight CSV/PNG outputs
# and summary.csv/.md are tracked, same convention as raw_data/ above.
simulation/results/**/sim.npz
